Hi everyone! 
I encountered this issue while looking for a way to enable manual edits on my setup.
It appears opencode has a great way to create custom agents with custom permissions.
You can check the following docs:
[Permissions](https://opencode.ai/docs/permissions/)
[Agents](https://opencode.ai/docs/agents/)

So I just added a custom primary agent named manual:
```
"agent": {
    "manual":{
      "mode": "primary",
      "permission": {
        "edit": "ask",
        "bash": "ask"
      }
    }
  },
```
